                                "sense_id": "4e090e1a-5cab-31d8-9629-43e28c2cb0e3",
                                "text": "The one who has the smoothiest hair wins."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5582df70-323e-45eb-a286-e3f8e41bde62",
                                "sense_id": "4e090e1a-5cab-31d8-9629-43e28c2cb0e3",
                                "text": "It will make your life smoothier and more enjoyable."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d326ddc1-8374-4f67-9e7f-1eda0db5f3e3",
                                "sense_id": "4e090e1a-5cab-31d8-9629-43e28c2cb0e3",
                                "text": "If you have a circular polarizer or a neutral density (grey) filter, put that in front of the lens too. This will slow down the shutter speed even further to get silkier, smoothier (that's a word!) water motion."
                            }
                        ]
